[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FFD700]Why AwesomeChat?[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

Most servers need 3–5 separate plugins to handle chat formatting, filtering, private messaging, and moderation.
[B]AwesomeChat[/B] replaces them all with one lightweight, well-integrated solution.

[LIST]
[*][B]Zero bloat[/B] – Every feature is toggleable
[*][B]Deep LuckPerms integration[/B] – Per-group everything
[*][B]Adventure API native[/B] – Full MiniMessage and hex color support
[*][B]Actively maintained[/B] for 1.19+
[/LIST]


[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FFD700]Features[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[SIZE=4][B][COLOR=#00BFFF]Chat Formatting[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*]Per-group chat formats via LuckPerms
[*]Automatic prefix / suffix integration
[*]PlaceholderAPI support
[*]Hex color support ([ICODE]&#RRGGBB[/ICODE])
[*]MiniMessage formatting (toggleable)
[*]Permission-based color & style gating
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][B][COLOR=#00BFFF]Chat Channels[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*]Create unlimited custom channels (staff, admin, VIP, etc.)
[*]Per-channel permission, prefix, format, and sound
[*]Toggle mode or one-off messaging
[*][ICODE]/ch join staff[/ICODE] or [ICODE]/ch staff Hello![/ICODE]
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][B][COLOR=#00BFFF]Chat Filter Engine[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]Cooldown[/B] – Rate-limit messages
[*][B]Spam detection[/B] – Jaro-Winkler similarity algorithm
[*][B]Censor mode[/B] – Replace bad words instead of blocking
[*][B]Banned words[/B] – Wildcard patterns from [ICODE].txt[/ICODE] files
[*][B]Anti-advertising[/B] – TLD blocking, phrase matching, regex
[*][B]Custom regex rules[/B] – Named rules with custom patterns
[*][B]Graduated punishments[/B] – Warn → mute → ban
[*][B]Command filtering[/B] – Filters apply to commands
[*][B]Violation logging[/B] – File + per-player records
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][B][COLOR=#00BFFF]Private Messaging[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][ICODE]/msg[/ICODE], [ICODE]/reply[/ICODE], [ICODE]/whisper[/ICODE], and more
[*]Custom formats and sounds
[*]Message toggle ([ICODE]/msgtoggle[/ICODE])
[*]Social spy for staff
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][B][COLOR=#00BFFF]Player Ignore[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][ICODE]/ignore <player>[/ICODE] – Hide chat & block PMs
[*]Persistent across restarts
[*]Staff bypass permission
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][B][COLOR=#00BFFF]Mentions[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][ICODE][USER=85605]@Player[/USER][/ICODE]
[*][ICODE]@(role)[/ICODE]
[*][ICODE][USER=2410880]@everyone[/USER][/ICODE] / [ICODE][USER=1820222]@here[/USER][/ICODE]
[*]Per-type sounds, colors, and action-bar alerts
[*]Permission-gated per mention type
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][B][COLOR=#00BFFF]Emoji Shortcuts[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][ICODE]:heart:[/ICODE], [ICODE]:star:[/ICODE], [ICODE]:fire:[/ICODE], etc.
[*]20 built-in Unicode emojis
[*]Fully configurable via [ICODE]config.yml[/ICODE]
[*]Permission-gated ([ICODE]awesomechat.emoji[/ICODE])
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][B][COLOR=#00BFFF]Join / Leave Messages[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*]Per-group join & leave messages
[*]First-join messages
[*]MOTD on join
[*]Configurable sounds
[*]PlaceholderAPI support
[*]EssentialsX vanish integration
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][B][COLOR=#00BFFF]Item Display[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][ICODE][item][/ICODE], [ICODE][inventory][/ICODE], [ICODE][enderchest][/ICODE], [ICODE][/command][/ICODE]
[*][B]Custom triggers[/B] – Define your own [ICODE][name][/ICODE] triggers with PlaceholderAPI output
[*]Hover tooltips & inventory snapshots
[*]Read-only GUI with expiry
[*]Permission-gated triggers
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][B][COLOR=#00BFFF]Chat Radius / Local Chat[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*]Distance-based chat
[*]Per-group radii via LuckPerms
[*]Shout prefix ([ICODE]![/ICODE])
[*]Optional cross-world support
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][B][COLOR=#00BFFF]Chat Logging[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*]SQLite or MySQL storage
[*][ICODE]/chatlogs <player>[/ICODE]
[*]Clickable pagination
[*]Fully async
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][B][COLOR=#00BFFF]Chat Color[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][ICODE]/chatcolor[/ICODE] — GUI picker with 16 standard colors, gradient presets, and custom gradients
[*]8 dual-color and 5 triple-color gradient presets (Sunset, Ocean, Royal, Ice, Aurora, etc.)
[*]Custom gradients with up to 4 hex color stops
[*]Style toggles (bold, italic, underline, strikethrough, obfuscated)
[*]Persistent per-player storage — survives restarts
[*]LuckPerms [ICODE]chat-color[/ICODE] meta takes priority
[*]Manual [ICODE]&[/ICODE] color codes still work and override
[/LIST]

